    "created_at": "2023-08-27T13:48:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-08-27T13:48:33Z",
    "body": "\"Parent reference\" isn't a concept in the spec. The parent-child relationship is _defined_ in https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#trees ; if X is a child of Y, then Y _by definition_ is a parent of X. When your implementation is using a two-way pair of references as an implementation detail of tracking this relationship, it probably should set them both at the same time.",
