    "created_at": "2023-08-27T14:10:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-08-27T14:10:38Z",
    "body": "> An object that participates in a [tree](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree) has a parent, which is either null or an object, and has children,\r\n\r\nI thought this expression meant that each node has an internal slot of parent and children.\r\nBut, certainly the word \"associated\" was not used.\r\n\r\nThe question has been answered. Thanks!",
